        "content": "<p>saulecabrera opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14377\">issue #14377</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The following program:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"WebAssembly\"><pre><span></span><code>  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">module</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"nv\">$f</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">return</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">try_</span><span class=\"k\">table</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">catch_all</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">))))</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>When compiled with:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">target</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">debug</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">wasmtime</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">compile</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">C</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">compiler</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">winch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">W</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exceptions</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"err\">\\</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">try_table_unreachable</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">o</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">dev</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">null</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Returns: <code>Invalid local offset</code></p>\n<p>And when compiled with:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">target</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">debug</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">wasmtime</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">compile</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">C</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">compiler</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">winch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">W</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exceptions</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">fuel</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1000</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"err\">\\</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">try_table_unreachable</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">o</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">dev</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">null</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Returns: <code>Invalid fuel state</code></p>\n<p>Note that the second error only happens with fuel and not with epoch. </p>\n<p>cc/ @macovedj </p>\n</blockquote>",
